IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT QUOTE STATISTICS
================================================================================

The original application includes:

Math.floor(Math.random() * 10000)

and:

new Date().toLocaleTimeString()


These values are generated during rendering.

That means an unrelated re-render can change the displayed quote number
or displayed time even when the quote itself has not changed.

If the requirement is:

"Each quote should keep the same number and fetched time"

then quoteNumber and fetchedTime should instead be generated when the
new quote is received and stored with the relevant quote metadata.


